    "I'm a privacy first application that lives here in the menu bar on your Mac, providing you a quick way to glance at your Continous Glucose Monitor (CGM) readings, from places like Nightscout and Dexcom": {
      "comment": null,
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I'm a privacy first application that lives here in the menu bar on your Mac, providing you a quick way to glance at your Continous Glucose Monitor (CGM) readings, from places like Nightscout and Dexcom"
          }
        },
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jeg er en app der respekterer dine private data, og jeg bor i din menulinie. Jeg giver dig en nem måde at hurtigt få et overblik over din Continous Glucose Monitor (CGM) data, fra services som Nightscout og Dexcom"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Je suis une application axée sur la confidentialité qui vit ici dans la barre de menu de votre Mac, vous fournissant un moyen rapide de jeter un coup d'œil à vos lectures de moniteur de glyémie en continu (CGM), à partir de serveurs comme Nightscout et Dexcom"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Icon": {
      "comment": null,
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Icon"
          }
        },
        "da": {
