          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The simulator has no settings and is a CGM provider implemented to enable you to test the application without connecting a real CGM provider such as Dexcom or Nightscout.": {
      "comment": null,
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The simulator has no settings and is a CGM provider implemented to enable you to test the application without connecting a real CGM provider such as Dexcom or Nightscout."
          }
        },
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Simulatoren har ingen indstillinger og er en CGM-udbyder, der er implementeret for at gøre det muligt for dig at teste applikationen uden at forbinde en reel CGM-udbyder, såsom Dexcom eller Nightscout."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Le simulateur n'a pas de paramètres et est un fournisseur de CGM implémenté pour vous permettre de tester l'application sans vous connecter à un véritable fournisseur de CGM tel que Dexcom ou Nightscout."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The target is used to correctly color the glucose values in the chart when you have it set to use dynamic colors.": {
      "comment": null,
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The target is used to correctly color the glucose values in the chart when you have it set to use dynamic colors."
          }
        },
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Målet bruges til korrekt at farve glukoseværdierne i grafen når du har den indstillet til at bruge dynamiske farver."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "La cible est utilisée pour colorier correctement les valeurs de glycémie dans le graphique lorsque vous l'avez configuré pour utiliser des couleurs dynamiques."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Token is required for GlucoseBar to function correctly. Please ensure your Nightscout instance has one set up and use it here.": {
      "comment": null,
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Token is required for GlucoseBar to function correctly. Please ensure your Nightscout instance has one set up and use it here."
          }
        },
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Token er påkrævet for at GlucoseBar kan fungere korrekt. Sørg for at din Nightscout-instans har en opsat og brug den her."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Le jeton est requis pour que GlucoseBar fonctionne correctement. Veuillez vous assurer que votre instance Nightscout a une configuration et utilisez-la ici."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These amazing people have helped make GlucoseBar a reality.": {
      "comment": null,
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
